Atech Atelier is the FreeCAD 1.1.3 AppImage with FreeCAD's program files
unmodified (Atech changes only AppRun, the icon and the desktop/AppStream
entries, and adds its own files; see ATECH_CHANGES.txt), distributed with the
Atech agent workbench (AcadAgent), Atech branding and the Atech module
library.

